Design and Aesthetic:
	•	A modern, sleek, and minimalistic design that conveys innovation and trust.
	•	Use of engaging animations and visuals to demonstrate solutions in action.
	•	Interactive sections to explore case studies or solutions (e.g., demo chatbots, service calculators).
